# AI Lead Generation

B2B lead discovery, scoring, outreach, and CRM. pnpm monorepo (turbo), TypeScript everywhere, Supabase (Postgres + Auth) as the database.
Ignore `AGENT.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.windsurfrules`, `.cursor/rules/agent.mdc`: they are auto-generated by the Jetro extension and unrelated to this project.

## Layout

- `apps/web` - Next.js 15 (App Router), React Query hooks in `src/hooks`, API clients in `src/services/api`, Supabase auth (`src/lib/supabase`, `src/middleware.ts`).
- `apps/api` - Express API. Routes in `src/routes`, domain modules (`campaigns`, `workflows`, `integrations`, `services/crm`, `services/leads`), and a DB-backed job runner (`src/jobs/runner.ts`, `src/jobs/registry.ts`).
- `packages/database` - Supabase client plus query modules (`src/modules/*`, `src/queries.ts`).
- `services/` - shared logic imported by the API: `discovery` (Serper/Places agent), `sarvam` (LLM), `search` (query parser, lead search), `signals`, `messaging` (Resend email, WhatsApp).
- `agents/scoring/intent.ts` - intent scoring agent.
- `supabase/migrations` - SQL migrations (source of truth for the schema); `supabase/functions/lead-webhook` - Deno edge function for Meta/Google lead ads.
- `tests/` - Vitest projects `unit` and `api` (supertest against a live Supabase stack), Playwright e2e in `tests/e2e`.
- Most other folders under `agents/`, `services/`, `packages/`, `infrastructure/` are empty `.gitkeep` stubs.

## Conventions

- Multi-tenant: every DB query and mutation must be scoped by `org_id`. Never add an unscoped query.
- Provider credentials (Serper, Sarvam, Resend, WhatsApp, Slack, webhooks) are resolved per workspace through `apps/api/src/integrations/credentials.ts`. Do not read provider keys from `process.env` directly.
- Outbound HTTP to user-configurable URLs goes through `apps/api/src/integrations/safeHttp.ts` (SSRF protection).
- Schema changes go in a new timestamped file in `supabase/migrations`; never edit an applied migration.
- Web data fetching uses React Query hooks; mutations should invalidate the related query keys (`src/hooks/queryKeys.ts`).
- Never commit `.env` files or build output (`.next*`, `dist`).

## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm --filter @ai-lead-gen/api dev     # API on PORT (default 4000)
pnpm --filter @ai-lead-gen/web dev     # web on http://localhost:3000
pnpm --filter @ai-lead-gen/api typecheck
pnpm --filter @ai-lead-gen/web typecheck

cd tests
pnpm test:unit       # no services needed
npx supabase start   # required for api + e2e suites
pnpm test:api
pnpm test:e2e        # starts API on 4011 and web on 3011
pnpm typecheck

npx supabase db push                                       # apply migrations to linked project
npx supabase functions deploy lead-webhook --no-verify-jwt
```
